        "Description": "Residents of Whittleton Creek knew about Cassidy&apos;s secret police since before he came and it&apos;s a nuiscence above everything else. They are busybodies and even conduct home break-ins. They have ramped up operations as Cassidy has moved in, and it is worse than ever. They want the elimination of three particular guards that are the ringleaders of the operation, as a warning to him.\r\rThey will not withstand collaterals, however, and many still don&apos;t know about this operation, so thread wisely.",
